a0=b?"Finish the cube!":"Ho\xe0n th\xe0nh cube!"
a1=b?"Hold yellow on top, put an unsolved corner at top-front-right.":"C\u1ea7m v\xe0ng \u1edf tr\xean, \u0111\u1eb7t 1 g\xf3c ch\u01b0a \u0111\xfang \u1edf tr\xean-tr\u01b0\u1edbc-ph\u1ea3i."
a2=b?"Repeat R' D' R D (2 or 4 times) until the corner's yellow faces up.":"L\xe0m R' D' R D l\u1eb7p l\u1ea1i (2 ho\u1eb7c 4 l\u1ea7n) \u0111\u1ebfn khi m\xe0u v\xe0ng c\u1ee7a g\xf3c h\u01b0\u1edbng l\xean."
