a1=A.b([a1,a2,a3,b?"The bottom layer looking messed up halfway is normal \u2013 it comes back by itself at the end.":"T\u1ea7ng d\u01b0\u1edbi b\u1ecb r\u1ed1i gi\u1eefa ch\u1eebng l\xe0 b\xecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng, cu\u1ed1i c\xf9ng s\u1ebd t\u1ef1 tr\u1edf l\u1ea1i."],s)
