a3=a2?"Trick 1: Skip the daisy":"Trick 1: B\u1ecf b\u01b0\u1edbc b\xf4ng hoa"
a4=a2?"Bring the white edges straight to the bottom face, saving 5\u201310 seconds.":"\u0110\u01b0a c\u1ea1nh tr\u1eafng th\u1eb3ng xu\u1ed1ng m\u1eb7t d\u01b0\u1edbi, ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m 5\u201310 gi\xe2y."
a5=a2?"No more daisy around the yellow centre.":"Kh\xf4ng l\xe0m b\xf4ng hoa quanh t\xe2m v\xe0ng n\u1eefa."
a6=a2?"Bring each white edge straight to the bottom, matching the side centre (see Step 1).":"\u0110\u01b0a t\u1eebng c\u1ea1nh tr\u1eafng th\u1eb3ng xu\u1ed1ng d\u01b0\u1edbi, kh\u1edbp v\u1edbi t\xe2m b\xean c\u1ea1nh (xem B\u01b0\u1edbc 1)."
a5=A.b([a5,a6,a2?"Exercise: scramble, solve only the cross, repeat 10 times, aim for under 15 seconds.":"B\xe0i t\u1eadp: x\xe1o cube, ch\u1ec9 gi\u1ea3i d\u1ea5u c\u1ed9ng, l\u1eb7p 10 l\u1ea7n, m\u1ee5c ti\xeau d\u01b0\u1edbi 15 gi\xe2y."],s)
