a6=a2?"Trick 2: Cross on the bottom":"Trick 2: Gi\u1ea3i cross \u1edf m\u1eb7t d\u01b0\u1edbi"
a7=a2?"Don't flip the cube after the cross.":"Kh\xf4ng l\u1eadt cube sau khi xong d\u1ea5u c\u1ed9ng."
a8=a2?"Keep the white layer on the bottom the whole solve.":"Gi\u1eef t\u1ea7ng tr\u1eafng \u1edf d\u01b0\u1edbi su\u1ed1t qu\xe1 tr\xecnh gi\u1ea3i."
a8=A.b([a8,a2?"You can see the top layer right away to find the next corner and edge.":"Nh\xecn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ngay t\u1ea7ng tr\xean \u0111\u1ec3 t\xecm g\xf3c v\xe0 c\u1ea1nh ti\u1ebfp theo."],s)
